# Badlands - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans, schematics and manuals whose SOURCE is
# physically in the Badlands, verified against the local Forever game data
# (questie-forever item vendor and drop tables). Two recipes are vendor-sold
# by in-zone Alliance-safe vendors (Yuka Screwspigot, Jazzrik); six plans,
# patterns, manuals and formulae drop each from a single named in-zone mob,
# five of them single-zone exclusives, the sixth from a mob that also spawns
# in two other zones and ships with a come-back note. Everything else
# Badlands-dropping is a generic multi-zone world drop (Elwynn rule), and
# quest records carry no reward data, so neither ships (see
# docs/badlands-companions-inventory.md and docs/companion-unverified.md).
# Trainer-taught staples are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides
# cover those. Each step is gated to its profession; other characters skip
# it cleanly. Alchemy, Cooking, Fishing and Leatherworking have no Badlands
# source, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/badlands-recipes
title Badlands - Recipes & Patterns
levels 28-40
zone Badlands
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords badlands, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Far south-west vendor - Yuka's stock (Engineering)

  zone map 1418

  when skill Engineering 1

  tip Yuka Screwspigot (4.90, 94.70) sells schematics in the far south-west.
  buy 10602 "Schematic: Deadly Scope"
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step Kargath-area vendor - Jazzrik's stock (Blacksmithing)

  zone map 1418

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  tip Jazzrik (42.47, 52.50), Blacksmithing Supplies, sells plans in the center.
  buy 10858 "Plans: Solid Iron Maul"
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step East - hard gold coif (Blacksmithing)

  zone map 1418

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  loop
  goto 64.36,23.75
  goto 65.52,22.05
  goto 65.66,23.49
  goto 67.13,22.09
  goto 68.08,25.08
  kill 2906 optional
  collect 251389 "Plans: Hard Gold Coif" optional
  note The Dustbelcher Warrior (level 36) in the east is the sole dropper anywhere in the data. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

