step South-west - dreambough wand (Enchanting, come back later)

  zone map 1418

  when skill Enchanting 1

  loop
  goto 7.10,90.78
  goto 7.57,85.70
  goto 7.66,89.53
  goto 7.85,88.13
  goto 8.00,92.38
  goto 8.06,90.89
  goto 8.55,88.25
  goto 8.64,91.00
  goto 9.62,89.29
  goto 9.68,88.25
  kill 2720 optional
  collect 249512 "Formula: Dreambough Wand" optional
  note The Dustbelcher Ogre Mage (level 43) in the south-west is the sole dropper anywhere in the data, though the same mob also spawns in two other zones. No quest takes it. Come back at high level - three over the guide band.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step No Badlands source - Alchemy
  note Alchemy has no recipe source physically in the Badlands in the data - no vendor sells them here and no in-zone mob drops them - so this guide carries nothing for it. Polestar's own profession guides cover trainer-taught staples.

